cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: fuzzy-membership
abstract: >-
  Fuzzy membership of spatial units in regions, derived from interaction
  networks. Measures how strongly each spatial unit belongs to each region of a
  plan, using the mobility flows and social ties that connect it to the units
  around it.
authors:
  - family-names: Kruse
    given-names: Jacob
license: MIT
